-Yeah, exactly.

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:33.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, yeah.
You're hunting.

00:07:33.986 --> 00:07:35.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Obviously.
Right, I'm hunting minds.

00:07:35.488 --> 00:07:37.056 line:92%
-You're hunting minds, exactly

00:07:37.056 --> 00:07:38.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You can't smile
